<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled by Codex from independent Tibetan-first and English-first proposals. The work title retains its Reasoning member. The world and ignorance are clear lexical atoms within the causal recast; rkyen can du is omitted as a relational conversion from having ignorance as condition to ignorance causes, not falsely nulled or banked as an isolated dictionary equivalent. gang phyir contributes causal For; the separately inserted Why? remains unwrapped. de yi phyir na contributes then, while cis owns why; mi 'thad is kept whole as wrong. The exact HGM unit 'jig rten rnams owns many worlds, with worlds as its literal member, so rnams is not nulled. rang gi ngo bos owns the attested whole through some essence of its own: rang supplies the reflexive ownership, gi the possessive relation, ngo bo the essence and final -s the instrumental through. Its essence member is literal. ma is the negative exponent in the first none, and grub pa is the anaphoric existential does so at phrase depth; this asserts no separate participant. The later restriction tsam is distributed across none of them are anything more than and is omitted. The supplied our remains unwrapped. The English period is preserved; related corpus punctuation and the interrogative sense do not establish an editorial defect or independent publication history.</div>
