<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s231S">The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w1">400 Verses</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w13a">says</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s231p2">as well</span>: <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s231w4">Without</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w3">conceptions</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w5">desire</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w6">and such</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s231w7">Are nothing that can even exist</span>; Why then would <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w12">anyone</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w11">with a brain</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w13">Believe</span> in <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w8">reality</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s231p9">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w10">conception</span>? The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w14">commentary</span> to the work <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w25a">states</span> that-- Things that <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s231w16">can&#x27;t even exist</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s231w15">in the absence of conceptions</span> are, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w17">beyond any manner of doubt</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w25">absolutely</span> things that <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s231w24">cannot exist</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w22">through any <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s231m23">essence</span> of their own</span>: they are <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s231p21">like</span> a <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s231w18">coil of rope</span> you <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w19">label</span> with &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w20">snake</span>.&quot; The expression &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w26">reality</span>&quot; here refers to something that could <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w29">exist</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w27">through its own <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s231m28">essence</span></span>. &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w30">Conception</span>&quot; is the fact that things <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s231w31">occur</span> through the process of conceptualization.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled by Codex from independent Tibetan-first and English-first proposals. brgya pa is an abbreviated work title attested here as 400 Verses, not a numeral gloss of brgya. The two retrospective gsungs occurrences own the title-reporting says and commentary-reporting states, with explicit English reordering. sogs owns the established closing gesture and such, including its connective. The positive premise rtog pa yod pa kho nas yod pa nyid dang is not separately rendered by the negative-only English commentary clause and is omitted. The later rtog pa med par is retained whole so its conceptions cannot attach to the omitted earlier positive occurrence. Complete existential negatives remain at phrase depth. thag pa bsdogs pa is the compositional phrase coil of rope; the supplied you is unwrapped. The two rang gi ngo bos units retain their instrumental and reflexive relation to essence; their essence members are literal. The last definition is not banked whole: de la bltos te has a dependency and referent not securely rendered by through the process of conceptualization, and the English things subject cannot be read back into the Tibetan conception predicate. Only the locally secure Conception and occur atoms are retained; this does not endorse the entire relation. C16:808 differs in English vocabulary; P7:9 ends before the last word and ILL:1109 does not translate the closing definitions. Neither supports the unquoted closing relation or proves publication lineage.</div>
